00:18:27.253 --> 00:18:30.690
If the dollar and the Euro
ended about parody today

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:32.061
or the dollar ends up rising,

00:18:32.061 --> 00:18:34.215
that could be a significant notification

00:18:34.215 --> 00:18:35.777
to the rest of the market

00:18:35.777 --> 00:18:38.040
that there are real
worries about recession

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:39.773
and about the fate and about the path

00:18:39.773 --> 00:18:41.975
for growth moving forward.

00:18:41.975 --> 00:18:44.670
All right, listen, we were
gonna talk a little bit

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:46.260
about the Powell Press
conference, but I think I talked

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:48.270
about that Fed chair,
Jerome Powell highlighted

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:49.484
again super core inflation,

00:18:49.484 --> 00:18:52.080
that's that services ex housings

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.410
or core services, ex housing

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:55.985
really a particular
measure that's still rising

00:18:55.985 --> 00:18:58.530
and the Fed has said, our
eyes are still on that

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.270
and I think that was a
signal to the market.

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:01.290
Things haven't changed

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:02.669
the Fed is still doing what it's doing.

00:19:02.669 --> 00:19:05.070
Maybe we shouldn't have gotten all excited

00:19:05.070 --> 00:19:06.118
